---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — CityClick"
  description="CityClick terms of service. Fair use terms for research, personal travel planning, and commercial underwriting."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>📜</span> Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#152438] tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: October 18, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">1. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          CityClick provides municipal intelligence, travel logistics, and underwriting tools for personal, educational, and commercial site-selection evaluation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">2. Informational Purposes & No Legal Advice</h2>
        <p>
          While CityClick audits its metrics against official federal and municipal sources, all metrics, lease formulas, and tax rates are provided for planning and informational purposes. Users are advised to verify building permits and zoning directly with local municipal planning departments prior to executing binding commercial leases.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">3. Open Data & Attribution</h2>
        <p>
          Public datasets compiled from US federal agencies remain governed by their respective public domain and open license terms (CC-BY-4.0).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">4. Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For legal inquiries or licensing questions, contact <a href="mailto:legal@cityclick.com" class="text-[#1D68F2] font-bold hover:underline">legal@cityclick.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
